{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation capabilities using only the provided events. The specification enforces safe exploration with a strong bias toward forward progress, always turning right for recovery, and never enabling forward motion when a front obstacle is present. Recovery from any obstacle is handled by a single rotate_clockwise action, and the supervisor returns to forward exploration as soon as the path is clear.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model perception and actuation as a single plant automaton with all possible sensor outcomes and motion commands.",
    "Specification automaton enforces: (1) move_forward only when path is clear, (2) rotate_clockwise as the only recovery, (3) immediate return to forward progress after path_clear, (4) no conflicting or oscillatory choices."
  ],
